Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.40,0:02:42.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(360,655)}I am grateful\Nfor this pause.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.03,0:02:45.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(360,655)}I give my mind
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.84,0:02:46.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(360,655)}permission\Nto settle.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.67,0:02:51.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(360,655)}I prepare for a\Npeaceful rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.83,0:02:55.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(360,655)}I welcome\Ntomorrow
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.87,0:02:57.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(360,655)}as a fresh\Nbeginning.
